      <chord name="Gdim"/>The <chord name="Ab"/>blessed <chord name="Gdim"/>Bible <chord name="Fm"/>brings:<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>His <chord name="Fm"/>face <chord name="Eb"/>will <chord name="Fm"/>shine <chord name="Ab"/>like <chord name="Bbm"/>sunlight,<br/>
      <chord name="Bbm"/>His <chord name="Cm"/>head be <chord name="Bbm"/>white <chord name="Ab"/>as <chord name="Bbm"/>snow,<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>His eyes <chord name="Cm"/>like <chord name="Ab"/>flaming firelight,<br/>
