      <chord name="Ab"/>And <chord name="Fm"/>at <chord name="Eb"/>this <chord name="Fm"/>wondrous <chord name="Bbm"/>greeting<br/>
      <chord name="Bbm"/>The <chord name="Cm"/>dead in <chord name="Bbm"/>Christ <chord name="Ab"/>shall <chord name="Bbm"/>rise,<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>Their <chord name="Cm"/>Lord <chord name="Ab"/>and <chord name="Bbm"/>Savior <chord name="Gdim"/>meeting<br/>
