      <chord name="Eb"/>Where <chord name="Cm"/>we <chord name="Ab"/>that <chord name="Bbm"/>wondrous <chord name="Gdim"/>hour<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>Shall <chord name="Fm"/>see <chord name="Eb"/>Him <chord name="Fm"/>face <chord name="Ab"/>to face.
